      <p style="margin-top:20px">Welcome to Ybor.ai. These Terms of Use apply to use of this website and related mobile services (collectively, the "Site"). As used in these Terms of Use, "we," "us," or "our" refers to Ybor Technology, LLC and its affiliates.</p>
